        ],
        "start_codepoint": 37,
        "end_codepoint": 81,
        "source_quote": "自州郡庶幾及四方人士，往來相見，或言議而去，或結厚而別，風聲流聞，遠近稱之。權妻以策女。",
        "reading": "來見之人甚眾。孫權以孫策之女妻邵。此未說她生顧譚、顧承。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:reading-081-152",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048",
        "person_id": "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "gnp_pzu_b4z"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 81,
        "end_codepoint": 152,
        "source_quote": "年二十七，起家爲豫章太守。下車祀先賢徐孺子之墓。優待其後。禁其淫祀非禮之祭者。小吏資質佳者，輒令就學，擇其先進，擢置右職，舉善以教，風化大行。",
        "reading": "二十七歲起家豫章太守，祭徐孺子墓，優其後，擢學而善者。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:reading-152-198",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048",
        "person_id": "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "esa_6ie_bng",
          "hev_imm_k3r",
          "pax_gtm_aew",
          "i5r_vby_q00"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 152,
        "end_codepoint": 198,
        "source_quote": "初，錢唐丁諝出於役伍，陽羨張秉生於庶民。烏程呉粲、雲陽殷禮起乎微賤，邵皆拔而友之，爲立聲譽。",
        "reading": "自役伍、庶民、微賤中拔丁諝、張秉、呉粲、殷禮。呉粲與卷57吾粲為烏程人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:reading-198-285",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048",
        "person_id": "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "hev_imm_k3r"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 198,
        "end_codepoint": 285,
        "source_quote": "秉遭大喪，親爲制服結絰。邵當之豫章，發在近路，值秉疾病，時送者百數。邵辭賓客曰：\"張仲節有疾，苦不能來別，恨不見之，暫還與訣，諸君少時相待。\"其留心下士，惟善所在，皆此類也。",
        "reading": "張秉字仲節。顧邵為秉治喪、臨行候疾。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:reading-285-310",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048",
        "person_id": "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "esa_6ie_bng",
          "hev_imm_k3r",
          "i5r_vby_q00",
          "pax_gtm_aew"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 285,
        "end_codepoint": 310,
        "source_quote": "諝至典軍中郎，秉雲陽太守，禮零陵太守，粲太子少傅。",
        "reading": "丁、張、殷、吾四人的後任分別回繫。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:reading-310-331",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048",
        "person_id": "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "syc_ik6_bq5_**AAA",
          "syc_ik6_bq5_**AAB"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 310,
        "end_codepoint": 331,
        "source_quote": "世以邵爲知人。在郡五年，卒官，子譚、承雲。",
        "reading": "顧邵在郡五年卒，子譚、承。殿本兩名後直接接譚傳。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei01-01:reading-000-069",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei01-01",
        "person_id": "16y_k92_fmm",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "14x_ic4_ly3",
          "572_278_cba"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 69,
        "source_quote": "吴录曰：敦字叔方，静字玄风，并吴郡人。敦德量渊懿，清虚淡泊，又善文辞。孙权为车骑将军，辟西曹掾，转主簿，出补海昬令，甚有惠化，年三十二卒。",
        "reading": "吳錄記張敦字叔方，吳郡人；受辟及海昬令。三十二歲卒。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei01-01:reading-069-076",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei01-01",
        "person_id": "14x_ic4_ly3",
        "related_person_ids": [],
        "start_codepoint": 69,
        "end_codepoint": 76,
        "source_quote": "卜静终於剡令。",
        "reading": "卜靜字玄風，最終為剡令。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-01:reading-000-074",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-01",
        "person_id": "i5r_vby_q00",
