        ],
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 74,
        "source_quote": "礼子基作通语曰：礼字德嗣，弱不好弄，潜识过人。少为郡吏，年十九，守吴县丞。孙权为王，召除郎中。后与张温俱使蜀，诸葛亮甚称叹之。稍迁至零陵太守，卒官。",
        "reading": "殷基《通語》記父禮字德嗣，守吳縣丞時十九，與張溫使蜀，卒於零陵太守。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-02:reading-000-030",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-02",
        "person_id": "i5r_vby_q00_A",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "i5r_vby_q00"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 30,
        "source_quote": "文士传曰：礼子基，无难督，以才学知名，著通语数十篇。有三子。",
        "reading": "《文士傳》記殷禮子殷基及其著《通語》。基三子，本文僅具二名。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-02:reading-030-065",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-02",
        "person_id": "i5r_vby_q00_AA",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "i5r_vby_q00_A"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 30,
        "end_codepoint": 65,
        "source_quote": "巨字元大，有才器，初为吴偏将军，统家部曲，城夏口，吴平后，为苍梧太守。",
        "reading": "殷巨字元大，歷吳偏將軍、晉蒼梧太守。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-02:reading-065-078",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei02-02",
